# DOT

DOT is a trustworthy digital public-service platform for agricultural procurement. Brand: **DOT** / **BY DOT TEAM**. Feeling: government service + agriculture + trust + simplicity. Not a generic AI SaaS dashboard.

One-liner: DOT helps farmers find suitable centres, book slots, get a digital token, track queues, manage procurement, and check payments.

## Entry flow (no app features before Home)

Language (தமிழ் / English) → Landing (What is DOT? + Get Started) → Login (mobile only) → OTP → Role → Home.

Do not put mandi cards, stats, feature checklists, or Google login on landing/login. Google OAuth is postponed. Mock OTP is OK; keep the structure ready for Supabase phone OTP.

## Farmer first

Build the full clickable farmer journey before deepening Centre/Admin: Home → Book (crop, quantity, recommendation, centre, slot, summary) → Token → Queue → Procurement → Payment. Also Alerts + Profile. Centre and Admin exist as basic DOT-looking screens.

## UX

Follow Smart Mandi: large readable text, green/white, dark green headings, large buttons, simple icons, farmer wording, EN+TA with natural Tamil. User always knows where they are, what they can do, and what is next.

Nav mental model: Home, Book, Token, Alerts, Profile. Desktop can use compact top/bottom nav, not a giant SaaS sidebar.

## Prototype

Complete workflow > fancy UI. Mock data is fine; never claim it is live. Every important button must work. No fake charts, maps, blockchain, or decorative analytics. No unnecessary gradients/animations. Ready to swap mocks for Supabase later.

## Build order

Finish one flow and test it before the next. Current focus after auth: Farmer Home matching Smart Mandi, then booking through payment, then Centre, then Admin, then real backend.
